et biologische wapens voor. De dreiging tegen Groot-Brittannië maakt Bonds onderzoek urgent, maar zijn privéleven laat zich niet eenvoudig van het werk losmaken. Fleming brengt de jacht op een vertrouwde tegenstander samen met een relatie die voor Bond meer betekent dan een tijdelijk onderdeel van een geheime missie.","work_id":987146050,"evidence":[{"note":"Retain existing Work5054 On Her Majesty''s Secret Service / Ian Fleming and exact Dutch In dienst van Hare Majesteit 9789044907223 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-025.json retained. Source''s final outcome omitted. Novel not film treatment. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p086213822","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p864619812"],"reference":"work:5054","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-025.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL85744W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p086213822","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p864619812"]},{"note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789044907223","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":15111501,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","editionKey":"/books/OL32107890M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"langu